  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien glove-puppet wuxia theme song in the kim-kong puppet-show tradition, orchestral rock. A suona fanfare in the intro; an erhu carrying the lead melody; a distorted lead guitar doubling the chorus hook; a string section with timpani and tom rolls; a big gong crash closing each section; the bridge doubles into a fast battle section. Theatrical and wide, strings and gong roomy, the vocal forward. Heroic male baritone in full chest voice with wide phrasing, the first verse and the outro spoken in a puppeteer's declamatory narrator voice over a low drone. 84 BPM, A minor. Mock-heroic and dead serious about a chess game. No beiguan procession drums, no metal screams, no breakdowns, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no pop piano ballad.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n下晡兩點 廟口榕仔跤\n一盤象棋 擺佇椅條頂\n東爿 剃頭的阿水伯 拖鞋褪一跤\n西爿 退休的老校長 葵扇搖袂停\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n觀棋 本底愛無聲\n後壁 煞徛規排人\n\n[Chorus]\n車馬炮!一出手!\n楚河漢界 無人讓\n榕仔葉 落一片\n一步棋 見輸贏\n\n[Verse]\n阿水伯 使出一招當頭炮\n老校長 回一招屏風馬\n後壁的阿伯 喝「食伊的車!」\n兩位大俠 同時越頭「你莫插喙!」\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n觀棋 本底愛無聲\n賣豆花的 嘛停落來看\n\n[Chorus]\n車馬炮!一出手!\n楚河漢界 無人讓\n榕仔葉 落一片\n三點半 猶未分\n\n[Bridge]\n五點 阿水嫂 喝一聲\n「轉來食飯!菜冷去矣!」\n兩位大俠 相看一下\n這盤棋 啥人攏毋准動\n\n[Chorus]\n車馬炮!一出手!\n楚河漢界 今暝休兵\n報紙 崁佇棋盤頂\n明仔下晡 才分輸贏\n\n[Outro]\n欲知 啥人先將軍\n且聽 下回分解",
